How to run the frontend project in terminal

# Terminal 1
npm run dev

# Terminal 2
npm run worker:dev

# stripe CLI run 
1. open the terminal in c>stripe
2. run the command
    ./stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/billing/webhooks



I am making a provider engine that will select which providr model the user is requested for. 

 



guidelines for running edge model in local machine: 

1. run the env using conda
2. install requirements 
    pip install -r requirements.txt
3. set environment: $env:EDGE_TTS_API_KEY="your_secret_key"
4. run server: uvicorn app:app --reload --port 8000






frontend in vercel
worker in render
tts model in huggingface
